In the coming year, the committee’s primary focus will be to improve guidelines and regulations related to child care services in Selangor. According to recent police reports, child abuse and sexual abuse cases in Selangor have been the highest in Malaysia for three consecutive years. This highlights the critical need to review and improve existing legal frameworks and guidelines to ensure the safety of children.

